<title>UK: Merrill Lynch adds 200 bln lire to FRN.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch adds 200 bln lire to FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been increased to 600 billion lire from 400 billion lire, joint lead managers Credito Italiano and Merrill Lynch said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT   *600 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    05.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     5 BP	PAY DATE  S-24.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  100.065   FULL FEES   10 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    100.065</p>
<p> NOTES     *FUNGIBLE WITH ORIGINAL LAUNCHED 13.FEB.97</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  5 BP	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
